<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba SC acquires French plastics firm.</title>
<headline>Ciba SC acquires French plastics firm.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ciba Specialty Chemicals AG said it acquired the privately-held French plastics materials company T2L.</p>
<p>T2L, headquartered in Quillan, France, develops, produces and sells plastics materials for the machine tool industry, Ciba Specialty said. It said T2L had sales of 15 million Swiss francs. It employs 48 workers. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
